sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Browser
  participant ST as stacks
  participant C as Rails.cache (10 min)
  participant PU as purl
  participant S3 as Weka S3 (stacks content)
  participant M as sdr-metrics-api

  U->>ST: GET /file/:druid/:filename
  ST->>C: public json for druid?
  alt cache miss
    ST->>PU: GET /:druid.json
    PU->>S3: GET versions/cocina.N.json
    PU-->>ST: public cocina
    ST->>C: store for 10 min
  end
  ST->>ST: find file, read access (view, download, location)
  ST->>ST: CocinaAbility check (world, stanford, location, service JWT)
  alt not allowed
    ST-->>U: 401 or 403 (login link for stanford-only)
  else allowed
    ST->>M: TrackDownloadJob POST /ahoy/events (async)
    ST->>S3: GET content/md5 (Range if requested)
    S3-->>ST: bytes
    ST-->>U: 200 or 206 stream
  end
